    "detailed_description": "<h1>Check out all our RE:CODE games!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732610/extras/5bba72f9ff3c9c88a0bcb8f5924b4b51.poster.avif?t=1736087058\" width=600 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732610/extras/5bba72f9ff3c9c88a0bcb8f5924b4b51.webm?t=1736087058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732610/extras/5bba72f9ff3c9c88a0bcb8f5924b4b51.mp4?t=1736087058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Your friend disappears in the middle of the night during an isolated forest cabin trip. It's up to you to find them, although it appears the forest may be holding a dark, unexpected secret. <br><br>It's up to you to brave the secrets of the forest and rescue your friend, and get out while you both still can... or while <i><strong>you</strong></i> still can.<br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Large randomly generated environments ensuring each playthrough is fresh. A large randomly generated forest and underground tunnel network to explore.<br></li><li>Replayability due to random generations of each new playthrough. Randomized environment, placement of loot, items, points of interest, etc<br></li><li>Play alone or online with up to a total of four players<br></li><li>Multiplayer proximity voice chat and text chat<br></li><li>Survival elements - how long will you survive in a strange forest, or will you make it out?<br></li><li>Multiple endings - Find hidden lore and uncover the true sinister secrets beneath...<br></li><li>Explore the surface of the forest and the secretive caverns below it...<br></li><li>Global leaderboards for things such as fastest escape... can you and your friends set a record?</li></ul><br>Nothing is at is 